      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fayette%2C_New_York",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Whitmer log home, rebuilt in 1980, now serves as a religious historical site operated by the LDS Church.",
